  "tip": "<p>When a question emphasizes <i>continuous reads and writes</i> during a <i>regional outage</i> look for built in <i>multi region</i> configurations with <i>synchronous</i> replication and <i>automatic failover</i> rather than exports, backups, or asynchronous pipelines.</p>",
